# Root build context (deploy/Dockerfile.caddy). Keep host-side artifacts and secrets out of
# images: without this, `COPY frontend .` would overlay the host's node_modules/dist on the
# in-image install, and the context would ship .git, virtualenvs and .env files.
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.db
e2e
docs
